{
    "title": "MOJO Sports",
    "description": "MOJO, the only all-in-one app for youth sports, is now a TeamSnap company. \r\n\r\nAnd it\u2019s still FREE for coaches to use with their teams.\r\n\r\nWith MOJO, coaches save hours of aggravation and stress searching for drills, planning practices and managing their team \u2014 because it\u2019s all in one place. And parents stay on top of what\u2019s going on at games and practice, all season long.\r\n\r\nMOJO features effective, easy-to-follow instructional videos, simplified team management and dynamic practice-planning tools so that coaches and parents focus on what matters most \u2014 helping kids get the most out of sports and making memories for a lifetime.\r\n\r\nCOACHING, MADE EASY\r\nCoaching sports is hard. Coaching kids is even harder. That\u2019s why MOJO provides unparalleled training videos, advice and information for the most popular youth sports. No matter what coaching throws your way, MOJO has you covered with expert advice, Q&As and interviews, with partners like the Positive Coaching Alliance and Aspen Institute\u2019s Project Play.\r\n\r\nWith MOJO, coaching isn\u2019t just easy \u2014 it\u2019s world class. \r\n\r\nMOJO collaborated with FC Barcelona to bring never-before-seen games, drills and curriculum from their famed youth academy. And with partners like MLS, US Youth Soccer and more, kids learn from the best soccer players and coaches in the world.\r\n\r\nMOJO partnered with Major League Baseball to create fun, dynamic practices for youth baseball and softball teams, featuring the same age-appropriate videos and practice plans you\u2019d expect from MOJO.\r\n\r\nMOJO worked with the Jr. NBA, the official youth basketball participation program of the NBA and WNBA, to create more than 120 activities that can be replicated at practice or at home, in addition to games and exercises to help advance on-court development.\r\n\r\nAnd in partnership with NFL FLAG, the official flag football league of the NFL, MOJO created a fun, engaging curriculum shot at the state-of-the-art SoFi Stadium in Los Angeles. Learn the game like never before \u2014 including the NFL Flag Playbook, brought to life on video for the first time ever.\r\n\r\nTEAM MANAGEMENT, SIMPLIFIED\r\nWhat time\u2019s practice? Where\u2019s the game? Who\u2019s got snack? MOJO makes it easier than ever for coaches and parents to answer those questions \u2014 and so much more. With intuitive, easy-to-use scheduling and chat, MOJO cuts the clutter and keeps everything that coaches and parents need for a season of youth sports in one convenient app.\r\n\r\nNEVER MISS A MOMENT\r\nMOJO\u2019s multimedia tools power unforgettable seasons. With the FanZone, parents can score games, live stream and capture highlights. And with a premium MOJO+ subscription, they can save it all to a player\u2019s profile, to share with anyone, anywhere, on any device. Now, everyone can be a part of a supercharged sideline experience.\r\n\r\nSubscription pricing and terms\r\n\r\nMOJO offers an optional auto-renewing subscription.\r\n\r\nPayment is charged to the credit card connected to your iTunes Account when you confirm the subscription purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the subscription period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period, and the cost of the renewal will be identified. You may manage your subscription and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to your Account Settings after the purchase. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when you purchase a subscription, where applicable.\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------------------\r\nTerms of Use:\r\nhttps://www.mojo.sport/terms\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\r\nhttps://www.mojo.sport/privacy\r\n\r\nCustomer Support:\r\nsupport@mojo.sport\r\n-------------------------------------------------------",
    "descriptionHTML": "MOJO, the only all-in-one app for youth sports, is now a TeamSnap company. <br><br>And it\u2019s still FREE for coaches to use with their teams.<br><br>With MOJO, coaches save hours of aggravation and stress searching for drills, planning practices and managing their team \u2014 because it\u2019s all in one place. And parents stay on top of what\u2019s going on at games and practice, all season long.<br><br>MOJO features effective, easy-to-follow instructional videos, simplified team management and dynamic practice-planning tools so that coaches and parents focus on what matters most \u2014 helping kids get the most out of sports and making memories for a lifetime.<br><br>COACHING, MADE EASY<br>Coaching sports is hard. Coaching kids is even harder. That\u2019s why MOJO provides unparalleled training videos, advice and information for the most popular youth sports. No matter what coaching throws your way, MOJO has you covered with expert advice, Q&amp;As and interviews, with partners like the Positive Coaching Alliance and Aspen Institute\u2019s Project Play.<br><br>With MOJO, coaching isn\u2019t just easy \u2014 it\u2019s world class. <br><br>MOJO collaborated with FC Barcelona to bring never-before-seen games, drills and curriculum from their famed youth academy. And with partners like MLS, US Youth Soccer and more, kids learn from the best soccer players and coaches in the world.<br><br>MOJO partnered with Major League Baseball to create fun, dynamic practices for youth baseball and softball teams, featuring the same age-appropriate videos and practice plans you\u2019d expect from MOJO.<br><br>MOJO worked with the Jr. NBA, the official youth basketball participation program of the NBA and WNBA, to create more than 120 activities that can be replicated at practice or at home, in addition to games and exercises to help advance on-court development.<br><br>And in partnership with NFL FLAG, the official flag football league of the NFL, MOJO created a fun, engaging curriculum shot at the state-of-the-art SoFi Stadium in Los Angeles. Learn the game like never before \u2014 including the NFL Flag Playbook, brought to life on video for the first time ever.<br><br>TEAM MANAGEMENT, SIMPLIFIED<br>What time\u2019s practice? Where\u2019s the game? Who\u2019s got snack? MOJO makes it easier than ever for coaches and parents to answer those questions \u2014 and so much more. With intuitive, easy-to-use scheduling and chat, MOJO cuts the clutter and keeps everything that coaches and parents need for a season of youth sports in one convenient app.<br><br>NEVER MISS A MOMENT<br>MOJO\u2019s multimedia tools power unforgettable seasons. With the FanZone, parents can score games, live stream and capture highlights. And with a premium MOJO+ subscription, they can save it all to a player\u2019s profile, to share with anyone, anywhere, on any device. Now, everyone can be a part of a supercharged sideline experience.<br><br>Subscription pricing and terms<br><br>MOJO offers an optional auto-renewing subscription.<br><br>Payment is charged to the credit card connected to your iTunes Account when you confirm the subscription purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the subscription period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period, and the cost of the renewal will be identified. You may manage your subscription and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to your Account Settings after the purchase. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when you purchase a subscription, where applicable.<br><br>-------------------------------------------------------<br>Terms of Use:<br>https://www.mojo.sport/terms<br><br>Privacy Policy:<br>https://www.mojo.sport/privacy<br><br>Customer Support:<br>support@mojo.sport<br>-------------------------------------------------------",
